{"name": "Mutate! Fight! Purr!", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1786961878\" width=\"736\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RITUAL MUTATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/8ffb9116f0d37be6b1e92d551fd5b378.poster.avif?t=1786961878\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/8ffb9116f0d37be6b1e92d551fd5b378.webm?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/8ffb9116f0d37be6b1e92d551fd5b378.mp4?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mutate your Cat to unlock forbidden abilities and passive effects. Each mutation changes your game, pushing you toward risky decisions and new, unexpected playstyles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MYSTERIOUS EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/1063bd6a0af295285cf3309bdf212e6b.poster.avif?t=1786961878\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/1063bd6a0af295285cf3309bdf212e6b.webm?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/1063bd6a0af295285cf3309bdf212e6b.mp4?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through a shifting world of rooms filled with battles, rituals and strange events. Each run offers new paths, dangers, and opportunities to evolve your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SUMMONING MINIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/ebf71cc078bc340ad535ae6a1de9928c.poster.avif?t=1786961878\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/ebf71cc078bc340ad535ae6a1de9928c.webm?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/ebf71cc078bc340ad535ae6a1de9928c.mp4?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command a growing army of summoned companions. Minions attack, defend, trigger effects, and interact with your deck and mutations, forming the tactical backbone of every battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SYNERGY-DRIVEN DECKBUILDING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/308f08f4dabb19321502b8cded5cb7cb.poster.avif?t=1786961878\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/308f08f4dabb19321502b8cded5cb7cb.webm?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/308f08f4dabb19321502b8cded5cb7cb.mp4?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect unique cards designed around combinations and synergies. Cards interact, amplify each other, and unlock creative tactical chains, rewarding smart deck construction over simple upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TURN-BASED TACTICAL COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/22a91bdf4791808bfa04c5c905ef5dbe.poster.avif?t=1786961878\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/22a91bdf4791808bfa04c5c905ef5dbe.webm?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/22a91bdf4791808bfa04c5c905ef5dbe.mp4?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat focused on positioning, initiative management, and smart sequencing rather than raw numbers. Every decision matters, mistakes are unforgivable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ADAPTIVE ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/a48b276cfd762e0c5c7ea41161bef479.poster.avif?t=1786961878\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/a48b276cfd762e0c5c7ea41161bef479.webm?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/extras/a48b276cfd762e0c5c7ea41161bef479.mp4?t=1786961878\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies are built to confront your strategies and synergies. No tactic works forever - those who can adapt survive.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A dark roguelike deck-builder where you play as a satanic cat, mutating into a hellish abomination. Wage turn-based tactical battles against festering infernal hordes, summon creepy minions, and build your cursed Tarot decks as your corruption deepens. Mutate\u2026 or die.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171610/9090b51c57dbd6fb43c7b0fe3f32f4899f663683/header.jpg?t=1786961878", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Card Battler", "Deckbuilding", "Roguelike", "Card Game", "Singleplayer", "Dark Fantasy"], "developers": "Sandman Team", "publishers": "Sandman Team", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4171610", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/_tO83pb0mbI", "first_seen": 1772492400.0, "review_rank": 1086}